":"\u003chttps://www.jsme.or.jp/ted/NL47/plazatota/plazatota.html|https://www.jsme.or.jp/ted/NL47/plazatota/plazatota.html\u003e","ts":"1637500436.110400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5wDBX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec0cd588-b321-4d0a-908b-2fddfee604ab","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"全体への熱伝達、というのはよく分かりませんが\n機器類の排熱をどこかに捨てなければならないですからね","ts":"1637500435.110200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H3oE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b9e31bd-3a64-4ff8-9cfe-b7f2a0ff6fd1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ放熱板あるのはしってるけど...","ts":"1637499111.108300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gug"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df9617ca-c45d-403b-acf7-aa2725dfcfcc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"液冷という名の全体への熱伝達システムなんかな?","ts":"1637499089.107900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wNFEU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1799f385-49ab-49ed-a747-d50a22e1f697","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そのうち中継地点としての計算機サーバー衛生みたいなのが誕生したりするんだろうか","ts":"1637499074.107500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jV=9e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"366b1b3d-afe9-40ae-90b8-737dea4b8c4c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"これも面白い\n\u0026gt; SBC-2について、フェルナンデス博士は「前回比で2倍の処理能力が許可された」と説明する。「許可された」というのは、ISSではコンピューターを動かすための電力も冷却も、さらには設置スペースも限られた貴重なリソースだからだ。今回のSBC-2では、前回の2倍の電力、冷却、スペースを使えるという。","ts":"1637499002.106100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dq9b/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c7e43be-c412-47f5-95b2-c180f83cb784","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u0026gt; これまでは大容量のデータを地球に送信することが不可能であきらめていたような処理も、エッジの処理能力が向上したことで可能になる。あらかじめエッジで処理を行い、得られた分析結果などのデータだけを転送することで、ISSから地上に送信するデータ容量そのものを大幅に減らすことができる。","ts":"1637498910.105700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qyugj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bca7bd9-97c3-417b-a145-b52ff566fa38","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u0026gt; 地球と宇宙（ISS）間の通信技術の進化よりも、センサー技術の進化が迅速に進んでいるため、通信がボトルネックになっていた","ts":"1637498856.105500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eTnZG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ba82f26-4f75-4fc8-a29d-053f41f26647","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://ascii.jp/elem/000/004/044/4044488/|https://ascii.jp/elem/000/004/044/4044488/\u003e","ts":"1637498801.105200","attachments":[{"fallback":"ASCII.jp: HPEとNASA、ふたたび宇宙でエッジコンピューティング実証実験","id":1,"title":"HPEとNASA、ふたたび宇宙でエッジコンピューティング実証実験","title_link":"https://ascii.jp/elem/000/004/044/4044488/","text":"米航空宇宙局（NASA）と米Hewlett Packard Enterprise（HPE）がまもなく、宇宙へのコンピューター打ち上げを行う。この「Spaceborne Computer-2」は国際宇宙ステーション（ISS）に設置され、宇宙飛行士の研究活動などを支援することになる。プロジェクトの主任調査員に聞いた。","image_url":"https://ascii.jp/img/2021/02/16/3158967/l/6cf2c91a95738edd.jpg?20200122","blocks":null,"service_name":"ASCII.jp","service_icon":"https://ascii.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://ascii.jp/elem/000/004/044/4044488/","original_url":"https://ascii.jp/elem/000/004/044/4044488/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EH52h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c63e6093-43b0-40d8-8f2c-f25afe4059fc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"液冷システムはISS自体の装置みたいです","ts":"1637498798.105000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XZcXs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f1bcd5d-9953-49bd-b5e8-21c4c499992b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"1気圧であること=空冷できる、でもないんだけどな\nまあできはするが、その空冷したあったまった空気をどうするかになっちゃうから(ISS全体の排熱は対真空で考える必要がある)","ts":"1637498639.104400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2IZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82c50a77-3f93-446d-b0ae-abbc6dae37e1","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/jyoshise/status/1462385344868159493?t=znWT82skNo-1UKItM9AvuA\u0026amp;s=19|https://twitter.com/jyoshise/status/1462385344868159493?t=znWT82skNo-1UKItM9AvuA\u0026amp;s=19\u003e","ts":"1637498540.103200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/jyoshise|@jyoshise\u003e: \u003chttps://twitter.com/kandabako|@kandabako\u003e ISSの中は1気圧なので、サーバー自体は空冷できます。が、その空気を冷やさなければならないので、サーバーを納めたロッカーと呼ばれる箱を液冷しているそうです。写真の向かって右側、それぞれのロッカーから2本ホースが出てますね。","id":1,"author_name":"jyoshise","author_subname":"@jyoshise","author_link":"https://twitter.com/jyoshise/status/1462385344868159493","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/871011100275363842/2m0NEI08_normal.jpg","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kandabako|@kandabako\u003e ISSの中は1気圧なので、サーバー自体は空冷できます。が、その空気を冷やさなければならないので、サーバーを納めたロッカーと呼ばれる箱を液冷しているそうです。写真の向かって右側、それぞれのロッカーから2本ホースが出てますね。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1637494810,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/jyoshise/status/1462385344868159493?t=znWT82skNo-1UKItM9AvuA\u0026amp;s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jyoshise/status/1462385344868159493?t=znWT82skNo-1UKItM9AvuA\u0026amp;s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rtbfX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9e41794-dc6a-4b5d-a3ee-7af4c0b801cf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"よく見えんけど、最上段のゴツくないやつはLANって書いてある気がする","ts":"1637498457.103000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k5ukU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"507f35be-b820-49da-90de-4c8b34d094da","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"写真左側にいくつかあるのがデータ線（これもゴツい）？","ts":"1637498311.102000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0XCjs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e09eddf-e23f-4a8f-ae15-adb7b99bcd73","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ISS、動的かつ人的な配管はどれも内部側でやるしかないので、ぱっと見がすごいことになっちゃう","ts":"1637498248.101800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j0X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0440ca4f-5032-441c-bc50-91532584bbb7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"よく見えませんが、ケーブルと配管が混ざってるようにも見えますね","ts":"1637498195.100500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p7Gj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0de3880-0b05-4d45-abd1-711fec94bb1a","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"なんだろこのコネクタ。同軸ですかね?","ts":"1637472093.099400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6hzzC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"166e6e5d-667a-4291-9687-54f70f730557","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"すごい","ts":"1637468503.098700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7qH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec0049b9-6c6e-4956-ae36-e77c84ec8a8a","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"ISS にスパコンおいてるんだ……","ts":"1637468501.098500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x7kR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fb91149-3ddc-47f9-a130-9b603bd7f69d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"全部のコネクタがゴツい","ts":"1637449624.098300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UX/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96bf7969-7155-4ff2-827b-44472a8cb719","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/jyoshise/status/1462138673793806344?t=w0L68iHi_9XY4vg8t0EImQ\u0026amp;s=19|https://twitter.com/jyoshise/status/1462138673